old_message_clean:
Consistently follow the CSS variable naming convention with font variable names. Document the fonts.

Separated font stacks from 'wikimedia-ui-base.less' into 'wikimedia-ui-fonts.less'

Renamed less variables:
@font-family-heading-main -> @font-family-heading
@font-family-serif -> @font-family-system-serif
@font-family-monospace -> @font-family-system-monospace

Deleted less variable:
@font-family-sans -- deprecated and unused
